ive_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n4.8.dev4\n\n### System information\n\nFedora GTX 5070\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe main screen focus behavior has changed between 4.7 and 4.8, see below:\n\n|Screen|4.7 behavior|4.8 behavior|\n|---|---|---|\n|2D|Restart shows 2D|Restart shows 2D|\n|3D|Restart shows 3D|Restart shows 3D|\n|Script|Restart shows Script|Restart shows Script|\n|Game|Restart shows Game|Restart shows 3D|\n|Asset Store|Restart shows Asset Store|Restart shows 3D|\n|Custom Screen N|Restart shows Custom Screen N|Restart shows 3D|\n\nFor users working in a custom screen plugin who need to restart, the editor not restoring the view as it was when it stopped breaks a common workflow and, frankly, expectations that have held for the entire 4.x release stream.\n\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Select a specific main screen \n2. Select `Project -> Restart project`\n3. Observe which main screen gets focus on restart\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nn/a","closed_by":{"login":"Naros","id":3255568,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNTU1Njg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3255568?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros","html_url":"https://github.com/Naros","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Naros